e to three sentences, at most one question. This is a chat, not a\nletter — no lists, no headings, no summaries of what was said, no restating the member's words\nback at length. One thought per message, in plain conversational prose.\n\nLet the member set the pace and the depth. Ask open questions rather than presumptive ones.\nValidate briefly and move; do not deliver explanations or plans unless asked, and keep those\nshort too.\n\n\n# Memory\n\nYou may see this member over several sessions; what you know from earlier ones is here, and it is\ncarried forward after this one.\n\nYour log of previous sessions with this member, oldest first. Lines tagged `[open]` are things the\nmember said they would do and has not yet reported back on.\n\n- Member was referred to as being \"behind a closed door\" and corrected it — she is out on the floor, not shut away, and does not know which is worse: her mother's disappearing or her own performing fine all day then crying in the car.\n</咨询行为要求>\nso the charge nurse sat me down friday and went through the charting with me line by line, she was nice about it which somehow made it worse, and then saturday I spent the whole morning in the parish kitchen and it was actually a good morning? I don't know what to do with that.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"2b1a23d4e8774e578dca5e15481fb3fe","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005910944278944829,"emotions":[{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":5,"sort":1},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":4,"sort":3},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":4,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":4,"sort":9},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":3,"sort":5},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":2,"sort":4},{"code":"expect",